  "filled_passage": "### A\n\nWe visited a small hospital (1) which stands near the river. The entrance has two glass (2) doors (door). One is (3) heavier (heavy) than the other, so a notice asks visitors to use the lighter one. My brother read the notice as (4) quietly (quiet) as possible while a nurse was speaking to a patient nearby.\n\n### B\n\nOn our first bird walk, the guide carried (5) less (little) equipment than I expected. She asked us (6) to keep our phones in our bags and listen carefully. At first I was not familiar (7) with the sounds. After an hour, I could tell the calls of two birds apart without looking at them.\n\n### C\n\nOn the way home, I noticed an elderly passenger (8) standing (stand) near the bus door. He was the neighbour (9) whose garden faces our kitchen window. I offered him my seat, and he smiled. Later he thanked me for (10) giving (give) it up. We talked about the flowers in his garden until he reached his stop.",
